    "/**\n * Expand `\\n` and `\\\\` outside tokens. A token's interior keeps its backslashes, because a Moment\n * format writes a literal with `[...]` and an author's `\\n` inside a `{{VALUE:…}}` label means\n * exactly what they typed.\n */",
