    "/** Whether `considerSubsections` may be honoured: only a heading line has a section to include. */",
    "/** Trailing blank anchor lines come from a `\\n` the author typed at the end and are not part of it. */",
    "/**\n * The line an anchor matches. A single-line anchor takes an exact line first, then a line that is the\n * anchor plus trailing whitespace, then a line that *ends* with the anchor (so `| --- |` finds a\n * table separator); a multi-line anchor only matches a consecutive verbatim run.\n */",
    "// Leading indentation is part of the anchor: `  - Parent` must not match a flat `- Parent`,",
